 have booster seats available for him to sit at the table.", "id": 2, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Female Customer</span>: Hey, that little boy just grabbed my purse and stomped on my foot!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The people in our restaurant deserve to have their meals in peace.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: This place is too strict. We're leaving ... Charlie!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would also advise you that screaming for your child in a crowded restaurant is not appropriate either.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Give the bill. I don't want to stay.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Certainly ... That might be a good idea. You can pay at the front. Have a lovely evening.", "id": 3, "time": "43000", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}